      <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-8 sm:gap-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">✅</span> Delhivery pickup from your doorstep</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">✅</span> Delivery anywhere in India</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">✅</span> 4-gate RTO verification</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">✅</span> Buyer confirmation via WhatsApp</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">✅</span> Real-time tracking for buyer</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">✅</span> AWB number + shipping label</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">✅</span> Instant RTO alerts to seller</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">✅</span> No Delhivery account needed</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl bg-gray-100 p-5 sm:p-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-4">
        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Regular Delhivery (no protection)</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 line-through sm:text-right">₹55</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-gray-200 pt-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-4">
        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">TrustShip (fully protected)</span>
        <span class="text-lg font-bold text-indigo-600 sm:text-right">₹<%= w[500] %></span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-amber-900">
        Pay just ₹<%= w[500] - 55 %> extra. Save ₹150+ per avoided RTO. Avoid even 1 RTO → you're already ahead.
